{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/extras/58cf1e7385cbe6b1f9161b0343229bc7.avif?t=1760423699\" width=450 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version of <i>Durga: The Lionhearted</i> includes the <strong>first two chapters</strong> of the full 10-chapter story. It is a <strong>playable demo experience</strong> that gives players a hands-on look at Durga\u2019s world, her abilities, and the narrative style of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/extras/a4ebd1261b216f0acfa358e85dd6c3a9.poster.avif?t=1760423699\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/extras/a4ebd1261b216f0acfa358e85dd6c3a9.webm?t=1760423699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/extras/a4ebd1261b216f0acfa358e85dd6c3a9.mp4?t=1760423699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this build, players can:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control Durga</strong> directly with full movement, exploration, and interaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>combat gameplay</strong> using her wooden staff against wild animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>environmental puzzles</strong> that unlock new paths and progress the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/extras/30e2c6f54994a1e3ac85f1ec2cb893ad.poster.avif?t=1760423699\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/extras/30e2c6f54994a1e3ac85f1ec2cb893ad.webm?t=1760423699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/extras/30e2c6f54994a1e3ac85f1ec2cb893ad.mp4?t=1760423699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a <strong>narrative-driven adventure</strong> with voiced storytelling and cinematic sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect herbs and other items that support survival and puzzle mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/extras/8dee129b593a4112d65624bb912139fa.poster.avif?t=1760423699\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/extras/8dee129b593a4112d65624bb912139fa.webm?t=1760423699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/extras/8dee129b593a4112d65624bb912139fa.mp4?t=1760423699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 2-chapter demo is designed to showcase the <strong>core gameplay loop\u2014fight, explore, solve, and survive</strong>\u2014while introducing the mythic world and story that will unfold across the full game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008360?t=1760423699","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/c2d853f258b1f4383d4716f6f9ba9cb1d0995e28/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760423699","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/5f77f933d2fc919df701f