\" ><strong>Control Durga</strong> directly with full movement, exploration, and interaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>combat gameplay</strong> using her wooden staff against wild animals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>environmental puzzles</strong> that unlock new paths and progress the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/extras/30e2c6f54994a1e3ac85f1ec2cb893ad.poster.avif?t=1760423699\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/extras/30e2c6f54994a1e3ac85f1ec2cb893ad.webm?t=1760423699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/extras/30e2c6f54994a1e3ac85f1ec2cb893ad.mp4?t=1760423699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a <strong>narrative-driven adventure</strong> with voiced storytelling and cinematic sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect herbs and other items that support survival and puzzle mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/extras/8dee129b593a4112d65624bb912139fa.poster.avif?t=1760423699\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/extras/8dee129b593a4112d65624bb912139fa.webm?t=1760423699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008360/extras/8dee129b593a4112d65624bb912139fa.mp4?t=1760423699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragrap